flowchart TB
    CTRL["HTTP-слой src/: контроллеры + DTO<br/>auth · employees · requests · directories<br/>schedule · calendar · settings · audit · notifications · health"]
    MW["Глобальные guards и фильтры<br/>JwtAuthGuard (@Public) · RolesGuard<br/>ValidationPipe · ProblemFilter (RFC 9457)"]
